{"title":"2021 JMPSC Invitationals Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be real numbers that satisfy\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/f/78f693cb7d70dc2ab468c46ec65dfa02a6894a28.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x+y)^2(20x+21y) = 12\\]\" width=\"196\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/a/51ade1fc90bda866ddcf52dd53182f1338a35a35.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x+y)(20x+21y)^2 = 18.\\]\" width=\"200\" height=\"20\" />\nFind <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/5/5d5105fd8736d04043b1f0215adb14e7f7d06c19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21x+20y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/9/8493d3e45b8a65a00e9ac86f4687df811b242f4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=(x+y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/c/a9c2749c44491a1d388d4f8cb79ee3ad451e7d64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=(20x+21y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\" /> to get the new system of equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/3/5d37b95fa7a281a7accd383f2d14c31ab0aa1a05.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2b=12 \\qquad (1)\\]\" width=\"121\" height=\"20\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/c/03c6ea2a6270c3e7fca424299fc11a22bfe71763.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ab^2=18 \\qquad(2).\\]\" width=\"126\" height=\"20\" /> Multiplying these two, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/0/eb0436feee9dec3bfc122bf6e348aa075d190ab3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(ab)^3=12 \\cdot 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"115\" height=\"21\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/d/39d70d0ad9ab16fcac730f9af2f644dc010c1be3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ab=6 \\qquad (3).\\]\" width=\"110\" height=\"18\" /> We divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/8/b88ea3916e8089c7edbccc3ff91e58e01a6e2682.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/a/55afdab16c8c49089c4d9ceeb8d3c8cf1f088be6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> and divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/6/626beed3a7eee094ce4b6cf79a49d81669f72d99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=3$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />. Recall that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/5524ea4336b35f1a5a903e30dd0912627bcaba17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=x+y=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"111\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/1/cb17a45aebbeacb3a648f693c33a9e30181127e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=20x+21y=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" />. Solving the system of equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/2/522fcbf631bc752864e6a48a89d83e99eeb04afc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x+y=2\\]\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/5/7252a554dc7e773be41b4a1b23113ce92b0e9e4a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[20x+21y=3,\\]\" width=\"115\" height=\"15\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/b/d2b8dbbb83a8d3692b0a129df7298265d7dd43bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-37$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"66\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/3/ae3b6337c6008fc6503466d59b00d32e01cb5c60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=39$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77c1841bdbd15a27c3c92a169a3166ebac5a14e2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[21x+20y=20x+21y+x-y=3+39-(-37)=\\boxed{79}.\\]\" width=\"445\" height=\"23\" /> ~samrocksnature\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each number shares are factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, which means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/4/1644e3785d8c2b23ea53c2cf5e0ade9e677f4f6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+y)(20x+21y)=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"184\" height=\"20\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/a/54abe49c29fdbf920d53d4890237037c2625a8c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/c/bbcf791f3387dc531c6a29b1b4fc8a10ce1ee6e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20x+21y=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"114\" height=\"17\" />. We see <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/b/d2b8dbbb83a8d3692b0a129df7298265d7dd43bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-37$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"66\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/3/ae3b6337c6008fc6503466d59b00d32e01cb5c60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=39$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/d/a9d86eff7e44a17e036ffaf3486b3be0795c5e06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$39(21)-20(37)=\\boxed{79}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"179\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~Geometry285\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiplying the equations together, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/1/52104f64ed82e0bd329833128b5a212f3c7933ed.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x+y)^3(20x+21y)^3=2^3 \\cdot 3^3 \\implies (x+y)(20x+21y)=6\\]\" width=\"464\" height=\"20\" />Therefore,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/9/8692f1fce6e72b180e32cfe2bcd029bb96979c1e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x+y=2 \\implies 20x+20y=40\\]\" width=\"244\" height=\"15\" /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/c/b2c1e8a5e894793d4ead0826de12dd82449c0d9f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[20x+21y=3\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"15\" />Subtracting the equations, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/b/d2b8dbbb83a8d3692b0a129df7298265d7dd43bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-37$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"66\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/3/ae3b6337c6008fc6503466d59b00d32e01cb5c60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=39$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />, therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/d/9ed96631c97d6663c83c65441df545dc01a4e970.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21 (39) - 20 (37) =\\boxed{79}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"179\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>- kante314 -\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems\" title=\"2021 JMPSC Invitationals Problems\">Other 2021 JMPSC Invitationals Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Answer_Key\" title=\"2021 JMPSC Invitationals Answer Key\">2021 JMPSC Invitationals Answer Key</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=JMPSC_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"JMPSC Problems and Solutions\">All JMPSC Problems and Solutions</a></li></ol>\n<p>The problems on this page are copyrighted by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://jmpsc.org\">Junior Mathematicians' Problem Solving Competition</a>. <span class=\"mw-valign-middle\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:JMPSC.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/a/ab/JMPSC.png/120px-JMPSC.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/a/ab/JMPSC.png/180px-JMPSC.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/a/ab/JMPSC.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018020003\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 201/1000000\nP